  "description": "A woman infamous for the rumors that she changes men every single day, that is Yoo Chaerin. One night, just before sleeping with her most recent boyfriend, Chaerin confirms his “less-than-impressive size” and immediately declares their breakup on the spot. Disillusioned with love, she is walking through a café with a coffee in hand when she collides hard with someone and spills it. Expecting an apology, Chaerin looks up… only to find an unexpectedly tall and handsome man standing before her. However, he does not apologize. With a cold expression, he brushes Chaerin’s hand away and leaves without another word. After their disastrous first encounter, Chaerin finds herself strangely intrigued by him. After asking around, she discovers that his name is Jang Ryuhyun and that he is a classmate from her year. He may be handsome, but he is also known for his unbearable personality and for being the “official campus outcast.” Chaerin then decides to seduce him completely, make him fall hopelessly in love with her, and abandon him without mercy. But in this relationship that begins in the most unexpected way, can he really remain nothing more than Chaerin’s plaything until the very end?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14151738), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4344001251)",
